  <item>
   <title>Chassidus: The concealment that results from tzimtzum creates the paradoxical reality whereby people…</title>
   <link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/avrohom55</link>
   <itunes:author>Rabbi Bergstein</itunes:author>
   <description>&lt;p&gt;The concealment that results from tzimtzum creates the paradoxical reality whereby people recognize that their life is primarily the vitality that lives within their bodies but they fail to recognize that it is divine vitality. This experience is facilitated by the infinite power of Hashem to limit and conceal. It is this power that is granted to all those who devote their lives to fulfilling the divine mission of revealing G-dliness within the world.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
   <guid isPermaLink="false">d7dda50c-8fe7-52fa-9991-f32062040b6a</guid>
